 "insight": [
  "The combined share of Luxembourg's imports from Belgium, Germany, and France was 56.6% in 2005 and is estimated to be 65.8% in 2025.",
  "The median share over the period 2005 to 2025 is 64.6%.",
  "The largest change between consecutive years was from 55.6% in 2009 to 64.2% in 2010.",
  "The share peaked at 70.1% in 2020 and was 69.7% in 2024.",
  "These values are in current euros and are not adjusted for price changes."
